    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563220/extras/cafb7991d061f20f9479cf7c6b9e328b.poster.avif?t=1744236310\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563220/extras/cafb7991d061f20f9479cf7c6b9e328b.webm?t=1744236310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563220/extras/cafb7991d061f20f9479cf7c6b9e328b.mp4?t=1744236310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt?</strong><br>Find a hiding spot, erase your tracks, and escape! But be careful\u2014hunters can track you down by scent alone! Maybe you'll hide in a trash bin\u2026 or behind a cabinet. But remember, every prey gets caught eventually!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>or Hunter?</strong><br>Track your prey, set traps, and corner them! But don\u2019t get too comfortable\u2014sometimes, the prey turns into the most dangerous predator! Keep your weapon ready, stay focused, and don\u2019t let your target escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Exciting Game Modes!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Hunt</strong> \u2013 4 hunters, 1 prey\u2026 Who will emerge victorious?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Mode</strong> \u2013 Nobody knows who\u2019s hunting who!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563220/extras/26add06c1ab69611b96f947ee50a57e0.avif?t=1744236310\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique  Characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrill at Its Peak!</strong><br>Every round is a new story, every game an adrenaline rush! Laugh as you escape, feel your heart race as you hide, and taste victory as you capture your prey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready? Will you be the prey or the hunter? Decide now, and let the hunt begin!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563220/extras/61c1fe51289d91b868d08fc9d798c1d0.avif?t=1744236310\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's in the Early Access?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Hunt Mode</strong> \u2013 4 hunters, 1 prey\u2026 Who will come out on top?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Mode</strong> \u2013 No one knows who's chasing who!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Unique Characters</strong> \u2013 Each with their own special abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Hiding Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Every object in the map can be your escape route! <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's Coming Next?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Game Modes</strong> \u2013 New roles, fresh mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Maps</strong> \u2013 Each with unique escape routes and dangers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Hunters</strong> \u2013 More abilities, deeper strategies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard &amp; Ranked Mode</strong> \u2013 Are you the ultimate hunter or the best escape artist? Prove it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563220/extras/8a2557df70dbc25d8b256f92b75fb521.avif?t=1744236310\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p>",
